<title>BAHRAIN: Albaraka Islamic Investment Bank 96 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Albaraka Islamic Investment Bank 96 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(million U.S. dollars)</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.11    vs    4.00</p>
<p> Operating income    14.20    vs   13.44</p>
<p> Operating expenses   3.00    vs    2.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.24    vs    4.35</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 56.78    vs   55.25</p>
<p> Total dividend	 2.50    vs    same</p>
<p>Full Name: Albaraka Islamic Investment Bank B.S.C. -- Bahrain newsroom +973-524424.</p>
</text>
